c10"]},{"id":"organic_properties--acidity-k007","sectionId":"organic_properties/acidity","unitId":"organic_properties","subject":"chemistry","text":"염기성은 전자쌍 가용성 및 짝산 안정성에 좌우된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_properties--acidity-k008","sectionId":"organic_properties/acidity","unitId":"organic_properties","subject":"chemistry","text":"amide N의 전자쌍은 carbonyl과 공명하여 일반 amine보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_properties--acidity-k009","sectionId":"organic_properties/acidity","unitId":"organic_properties","subject":"chemistry","text":"염기성이 낮다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_properties--acidity-k010","sectionId":"organic_properties/acidity","unitId":"organic_properties","subject":"chemistry","text":"aniline의 전자쌍도 방향족 고리에 비편재화된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_properties--acidity-k011","sectionId":"organic_properties/acidity","unitId":"organic_properties","subject":"chemistry","text":"수소결합 donor/acceptor 수, 분자량, 형태 및 극성은 끓는점·용해도에 영향을 준다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_properties--acidity-k012","sectionId":"organic_properties/acidity","unitId":"organic_properties","subject":"chemistry","text":"동일 탄소 수의 가지친 alkane은 접촉면적 감소로 끓는점이 낮은 경향이 있지만 녹는점은 결정 포장과 대칭성에 크게 의존한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_properties--acidity-k013","section